  "description": "As part of the expansive Ryobi 18V ONE+ system featuring over 200 cordless tools for diverse applications, the Ryobi 18V ONE+ RPI18-0 Cordless High-Pressure Inflator is your go-to solution for inflating bike tires, car tires, sports balls, and more with ease. Enjoy unparalleled convenience with this inflator, capable of inflating a car tire to 32PSI in just 42 seconds. The intuitive auto shut-off mode simplifies PSI settings, allowing the inflator to handle the rest autonomously. This feature ensures seamless operation and peace of mind as the inflator automatically shuts off, freeing you to focus on other tasks. The digital pressure gauge provides precise pressure readings, ensuring accurate inflation every time. Additionally, onboard accessory storage keeps the included sports needle, Presta valve adapter, and high-pressure nozzle organized and accessible. Powered by a 5Ah battery (sold separately), the Ryobi RPI18-0 Cordless High-Pressure Inflator can inflate up to 150 bike tires on a single charge, ensuring reliable performance for extended use. Please note, this is a bare tool - battery and charger are not included, allowing you to customize your power supply according to your needs.",
